    "created_at": "2016-06-02T19:07:29Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-06-02T19:07:29Z",
    "body": "The order is observable, but I don't have any strong opinion on whether observedAttributes should be before or after the prototype. I guess to me the reasoning was:\n1. Start with the constructor\n2. Get the observedAttributes off of the constructor\n3. Now get the prototype off of the constructor\n4. Now get things off of the prototype\n\nIf we rearranged this to switch (2) and (3) it would seem strange to me since all the prototype-related things no longer are together. It's less obvious why you get the prototype if you then go off and spend a step going back and messing with the constructor again instead of immediately using the prototype you got.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
