    "created_at": "2016-06-03T06:06:26Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-06-03T06:06:26Z",
    "body": "Forgot to cc @dominiccooney \n\nYeah, if we group things by the source object, the current spec makes sense.\n\nIf we group things by functions, `observedAttributes` has no value if `attributeChangedCallback` is not set, and the reverse if also true, correct? I didn't do in my WIP yet but it could be a possible optimization not to Get() one if the other does not exist.\n\nI'm not too strong either, but if the order doesn't matter, maybe it's nice to say impls can do these things in different order?\n",
